WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
A drone lifts off a launch pad.

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.510
It flies three metres
east, four metres north,

3
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.240
then climbs twelve metres straight up.

4
00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.710
Now it hovers.

5
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.700
How far is it from the
pad, in a straight line?

6
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:16.900
Is it just three plus four
plus twelve, nineteen metres?

7
00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.430
In this mission, you'll add a third axis,

8
00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.680
with unit vectors i, j and k.

9
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.290
You'll find the distance
between two points in space,

10
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.830
and use parallel vectors to show
three points lie on one line.

11
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:34.190
Your mission: find exactly how far
the drone is from its launch point.
